Write-Host "    UX-01: aegis_dashboard/Cargo.toml: Added 9 missing dependencies (axum, tokio, dashmap, tracing, etc.)"
Write-Host "    UX-02: aegis_dashboard/src/udp.rs: Fixed port from 10000 to 10001 (was mismatched with brain's 9999)"
Write-Host "    UX-05: scripts/aegis_alerts.py: Alert viewer + acknowledgement CLI (view, ack, tail, filter)"
