Write-Host "    UX-11: scripts/aegis_defcon.py: Centralized DEFCON calculation (was differing in 4 components)"
Write-Host "    UX-12: nids_main.zig: SetConsoleMode(ENABLE_VT_PROCESSING) for ANSI color codes"
Write-Host "    Effect: 8 UX/frontend fixes - dashboard builds, CLI tools for alert/rule/DEFCON management"

